{% block content %}
  

<main>
<div class="page">
    <article class="article">
      <header class="head">
        <h1 class="title">How to Redeem an App Store Offer Code on iPhone</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="content">
        <div class="intro-media">
          <div class="text">
            <p>
              If you received an App Store offer code for Ultimate Streamer, you can activate it in just a couple of minutes.
              First redeem the code in the App Store, then check the offer inside the app.
            </p>
            <p>
              You can watch the short video tutorial or follow the illustrated step-by-step guide.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="video">
            <div class="frame">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/x_4msnOS_8Y"
                title="How to redeem App Store offer code on iPhone"
                loading="lazy"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                allowfullscreen>
              </iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Install Ultimate Streamer :)</h2>
        <p>
          If you have not installed the app yet, download <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6745222525" rel="noopener">Ultimate Streamer from the App Store</a>.
          Make sure you are signed in with the same Apple ID that will redeem the offer code.
        </p>

        <h3>Step 1. Open the App Store app on your iPhone</h3>
        <img
          src="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-001.png"
          srcset="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-001.png 1x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-001@2x.png 2x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-001@3x.png 3x"
          sizes="(max-width: 640px) 70vw, 260px"
          alt="Open the App Store app on iPhone"
          class="image-vertical">

        <h3>Step 2. Open your App Store profile</h3>
        <p>
          Tap your profile picture in the upper-right corner of the screen.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-002.png"
          srcset="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-002.png 1x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-002@2x.png 2x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-002@3x.png 3x"
          sizes="(max-width: 640px) 70vw, 260px"
          alt="Open your App Store profile on iPhone"
          class="image-vertical">

        <h3>Step 3. Tap “Redeem Code”</h3>
        <p>
          On your account screen, find and tap <strong>Redeem Code</strong>.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-003.png"
          srcset="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-003.png 1x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-003@2x.png 2x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-003@3x.png 3x"
          sizes="(max-width: 640px) 70vw, 260px"
          alt="Tap Redeem Code in the App Store"
          class="image-vertical">

        <h3>Step 4. Choose how to enter your code</h3>
        <p>
          You can either scan it with the camera or enter it manually.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-004.png"
          srcset="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-004.png 1x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-004@2x.png 2x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-004@3x.png 3x"
          sizes="(max-width: 640px) 70vw, 260px"
          alt="Choose how to enter the offer code"
          class="image-vertical">

        <h3>Step 5. Enter your offer code</h3>
        <p>
          Type or paste the code you received.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-006.png"
          srcset="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-006.png 1x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-006@2x.png 2x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-006@3x.png 3x"
          sizes="(max-width: 640px) 70vw, 260px"
          alt="Enter the App Store offer code on iPhone"
          class="image-vertical">

        <h3>Step 6. Tap “Redeem Offer” and confirm</h3>
        <p>
          Confirm the redemption on the next screen.
        </p>
        <div class="image-row">
          <img
            src="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-007.png"
            srcset="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-007.png 1x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-007@2x.png 2x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-007@3x.png 3x"
            sizes="(max-width: 640px) 44vw, 240px"
            alt="Tap Redeem Offer"
            class="image-vertical">
          <img
            src="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-008.png"
            srcset="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-008.png 1x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-008@2x.png 2x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-008@3x.png 3x"
            sizes="(max-width: 640px) 44vw, 240px"
            alt="Confirm the redemption"
            class="image-vertical">
        </div>

        <h3>Step 7. Open Ultimate Streamer</h3>
        <p>
          Wait until the offer code is redeemed, then open <strong>Ultimate Streamer</strong>.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-009.png"
          srcset="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-009.png 1x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-009@2x.png 2x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-009@3x.png 3x"
          sizes="(max-width: 640px) 70vw, 260px"
          alt="Open Ultimate Streamer app"
          class="image-vertical">

        <h3>Step 8. Open Ultimate Streamer settings</h3>
        <p>
          Tap the <strong>gear</strong> button in the upper-right corner to open settings.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-010.png"
          srcset="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-010.png 1x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-010@2x.png 2x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-010@3x.png 3x"
          sizes="(max-width: 640px) 70vw, 260px"
          alt="Open Ultimate Streamer settings"
          class="image-vertical">

        <h3>Step 9. Check whether your offer is active</h3>
        <p>
          Make sure your offer has been activated.
        </p>
        <p>
          If not, help the app refresh it. At the bottom of the settings screen, tap <strong>Restore Purchases</strong>.
          Wait a moment while the app updates your subscription status.
        </p>
        <img
          src="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-011.png"
          srcset="/assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-011.png 1x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-011@2x.png 2x, /assets/how-to-redeem-manual/how-to-redeem-manual-011@3x.png 3x"
          sizes="(max-width: 640px) 70vw, 260px"
          alt="Check the offer status or tap Restore Purchases in Ultimate Streamer"
          class="image-vertical">

        <h2>Troubleshooting</h2>
        <p>
          If the code is accepted in the App Store but the offer does not appear in Ultimate Streamer, first check that you redeemed the code with the correct Apple ID.
        </p>
        <p>
          Then reopen the app Settings and tap <strong>Restore Purchases</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>
          If you still have trouble, <a href="/feedback.html">contact us here</a> and include a short description of the issue.
        </p>

        <p>
          After activation, you can go back to the app and start streaming your games with scoreboards, replays and other broadcast tools available in Ultimate Streamer.
        </p>
      </div>
